sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Dashboard
    participant AuthGuard
    participant ApiClient
    participant Lambda
    participant UsersJSON as users.json

    Note over User,UsersJSON: Login Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Enter email + password
    Dashboard->>ApiClient: POST /api/auth/login
    ApiClient->>Lambda: POST /api/auth/login<br/>{email, password}
    Lambda->>UsersJSON: Read users.json from S3
    UsersJSON-->>Lambda: User records
    Lambda->>Lambda: SHA-256 hash password<br/>+ timingSafeEqual compare
    alt Credentials valid
        Lambda->>Lambda: Sign JWT access token (60 min)<br/>+ refresh token (20 days)
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 {accessToken, refreshToken, user}
        ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Store tokens in localStorage
        Dashboard-->>User: Redirect to dashboard
    else Credentials invalid
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 401 Unauthorized
        ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Show error
        Dashboard-->>User: Display error message
    end

    Note over User,UsersJSON: Authenticated API Request

    Dashboard->>ApiClient: Request data
    ApiClient->>ApiClient: Attach Authorization:<br/>Bearer {accessToken}
    ApiClient->>Lambda: GET /api/members (with Bearer token)
    Lambda->>Lambda: Validate JWT signature + expiry
    alt Token valid
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 {data}
        ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Display data
    else Token expired
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 401 Unauthorized
    end

    Note over User,UsersJSON: Token Refresh Flow

    ApiClient->>ApiClient: Intercept 401 response
    ApiClient->>Lambda: POST /api/auth/refresh<br/>{refreshToken}
    Lambda->>Lambda: Validate refresh JWT
    alt Refresh token valid
        Lambda->>Lambda: Issue new access token (60 min)<br/>+ new refresh token (20 days)
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 {accessToken, refreshToken}
        ApiClient->>ApiClient: Update localStorage
        ApiClient->>Lambda: Retry original request<br/>with new access token
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 {data}
        ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Display data
    else Refresh token expired
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 401 Unauthorized
        ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Clear tokens + query cache
        Dashboard-->>User: Redirect to /login
    end

    Note over User,UsersJSON: Logout Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Click logout
    Dashboard->>ApiClient: POST /api/auth/logout
    ApiClient->>Lambda: POST /api/auth/logout
    Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 OK (no-op server side)
    ApiClient->>ApiClient: Clear tokens from localStorage<br/>+ clear query cache
    ApiClient-->>Dashboard: Tokens cleared
    Dashboard-->>User: Redirect to /login

    Note over User,UsersJSON: Session Check (on mount)

    Dashboard->>AuthGuard: Layout mounts
    AuthGuard->>AuthGuard: Check hasTokens()<br/>in localStorage
    alt No tokens
        AuthGuard-->>Dashboard: Redirect to /login
    else Tokens exist
        AuthGuard->>ApiClient: GET /api/auth/me
        ApiClient->>Lambda: GET /api/auth/me<br/>with Bearer token
        Lambda->>Lambda: Validate JWT
        Lambda-->>ApiClient: 200 {user}
        ApiClient-->>AuthGuard: User data
        AuthGuard-->>Dashboard: Render dashboard<br/>+ display user in navbar
    end
